                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "- Playtime: 2 hours\n\n- Played: 2026\n\n- Context: I was looking for a simple puzzle game.\n\n[b]Review[/b]\n\nThis is a \"connect 3\" game in which you simply drag to select 3+ hexes of the same type to remove them. As you progress they add obstacles and support options. Roughly every games you make enough gold to select a building out of three to appear on a pre-determined spot in your city. There are also some pretty bad hidden object puzzles and a couple of \"put the pieces together\" puzzles.\n\nConnecting three by simply selecting things is rather dull compared to swapping places. The visuals and audio are pretty poor too.",
